#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizer build (the build-debug preset).
# Each entry is memory that a library keeps for the life of the process, which
# it never frees, so LeakSanitizer reports it when a test exits. The entries
# match a function or library in the allocation's stack.
#
# The tests labelled gpu are left out of the leak pass (docs/TESTING.md): the
# Vulkan driver frees its last allocations in code that it unloads before the
# leak check, so those stacks have no name to match or to blame.

# The Vulkan loader and the driver keep their instance and layer data until the
# process ends. Every test that makes a GPU device reports it.
leak:vkEnumerateInstanceExtensionProperties

# libdbus keeps the session bus connection, its registration and its message
# loader until the process ends.
leak:libdbus-1.so

# A key or pointer event made with no QGuiApplication (the config and key mode
# tests) gets Qt's default input device, which Qt creates once and keeps.
leak:QInputDevice::primaryKeyboard
leak:QPointingDevice::primaryPointingDevice
